# Valhalla container configuration. Copy this file to `.env` and uncomment
# one of the modes to switch. With no `.env`, the defaults apply (Atlanta-area
# routing via the Georgia OSM extract).
#
# See docs/VALHALLA.md for resource requirements and the operator workflow.

# --- Mode: full continental US ---
# VALHALLA_TILE_URLS=https://download.geofabrik.de/north-america/us-latest.osm.pbf
# VALHALLA_TILES_DIR=./valhalla_tiles_us
# VALHALLA_CONTAINER_NAME=flock-avoid-valhalla-us

# --- Per-container tuning (both modes) ---
# VALHALLA_SERVER_THREADS=2

# --- Build wait timeout (used only by scripts/build-valhalla-tiles*.sh) ---
# Each loop is 10 seconds. Default is 180 (30 min) for the Georgia extract;
# the full-US wrapper script sets 1080 (3 hours) automatically.
# VALHALLA_WAIT_LOOPS=180
